{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "10cb78dc-8cad-8ee9-ab6f-820128bfcb06",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T14:27:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dulce Fortes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:24:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, happy Monday. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Beth. Yes, my name is Dulce Fortes. So last week, Tuesday I think it was, my granddaughter's friend's mother told me the winter basketball for the youth was starting sign-ups. And then Thursday I looked on the computer and I couldn't find the form. So I'm calling to ask about the sign-up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:24:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to help. The winter youth basketball, yes. How old is your player?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:25:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She is ten. Fifth grade. I'm the one who handles the paperwork, so that's why it's me calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:25:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, anybody can bring the form in. Did you find a paper form somewhere, or do you need one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:25:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I printed one Friday at the library. It's filled out already. I signed where it says parent or guardian, and her mother signed too. So now I only need to drop it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:25:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Then you can just bring it by the Recreation office and hand it to whoever's at the front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What are the hours for the office? I would like to come this week. There's no money with it, just the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:25:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, we're open weekdays, eight-thirty to four-thirty. So you've got time today even, if you're close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:26:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eight-thirty to four-thirty. Let me write that. [pause] Okay. Today I can't, I'm out working right now. I'm sitting in the cab of a tow truck waiting on a customer, so I have a minute to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, a busy day for that, with the snow turning to rain and everything. Well, I'm glad you had a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's been steady since it started Sunday. Anyway, so Wednesday or Thursday I will bring it. Is there a deadline I should worry about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the exact cutoff in front of me. Let me check with the coordinator. Can you hold a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:26:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can hold. Unless the customer comes, then I will tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:26:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. [pause] Okay, I'm back. She says to get it in this week to be safe, and they'll contact you if there's anything missing from the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This week. Good. And they will call which number? I put the home phone on the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:27:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Whatever's on the form is what they'll use. If you want, you can tell me the number and I'll make a note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:27:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:27:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0157. I'll note that with your name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Oh, the customer is walking over now. I have to go. So, eight-thirty to four-thirty, this week, to the front desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:27:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it exactly. Thanks for calling, Dulce, and drive safe out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Beth. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
